# AIONS Architecture

> Linux = hardware layer · CBMS = cognitive system · MCP = execution layer · LLM = replaceable interface

- Do not grow MCP as the "brain" — decision logic belongs in `control_plane/` (Faza 3).
- MCP exposes tools; CBMS holds deterministic knowledge; Chroma holds semantic memory.
- "AIONS OS" means cognitive platform over Linux — not a custom kernel.
- When unsure: read `AGENTS.md` and `.claude/specs/AIONS_OS_ROADMAP.md`.
